WEBVTT

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>New Songs    Singer          Song Title 

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.010
<i>Okay!</i>

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:05.650
<b>Shinmei Amu</b>

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.650
<i>I've implemented your selection!</i>

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.070
I've been waiting for this, Asami-chan!

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.070
Whoo, whoo!

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.530
Wow, it's a cosplay of Shinmei Amu-chan, 
who's super popular right now.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.350
Oh, that's her?

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.080
I did say I would submit to any disciplinary 
action for destroying the building, but...

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.600
Yeah, think of it as an act of mercy from me,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.460
so that you'll never want to undergo 
disciplinary action again.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.010
You have to say her signature phrase, too!

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:35.340
The one that goes, "Everyone MiNacle!"

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.060
I'd rather die!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.390
How chaotic is this unit going to become?

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.470
We've taken yet another 
step back from my vision.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.560
Everyone!

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.540
MiNacle!

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.660
<i>In response to an increase in heinous crimes,</i>

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:03.190
<i>a new movement is picking up steam in police 
and security forces around the world.</i>

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.010
<i>This is the story of the services 
performed by ACTIVE in Japan.</i>

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:23.490
<b>File 3: Challenge From the Arena</b>

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.250
Take a seat.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.560
Uh, what?

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.460
Just sit here.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.630
But...

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:33.590
Two of the Japanese cocktails 
called "kakuyakuroman," please.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.980
Two?

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.960
They're strong, but really good.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.530
I'm underage!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.270
Oh.

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.360
Change one of those to a non-alcoholic beer.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.760
To tell the truth,

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.670
I thought you were just some 
idiot out to make trouble.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:48.580
Huh?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.640
But I think you aren't half bad.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.380
That's why we're having this toast.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:55.010
Well, if that's what this is about...

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.990
Well, let's begin, Kazari-san.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.660
Good job with the punishment karaoke.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.410
Cheers!

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.210
What are you getting next?

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:11.890
What should I get? I'm gonna drink lots today!

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:13.000
Nice drinking there!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.380
It's non-alcoholic beer.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.710
I still can't believe you dressed up like that.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.540
You could've claimed workplace 
harassment and said no.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.220
I didn't want to back down.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.260
You have real integrity.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.680
You think I'm stupid, don't you?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.270
Stupid?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.930
More like an idiot.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.510
A-An idiot?

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.350
I may not look like much, but I'm...

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:37.420
Now, there's no point in having 
a serious talk with a drunk.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.190
Yeah.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.200
Right...

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.120
Um, I've been wanting to ask you something...

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.910
Are you and Sena-san on bad terms?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.450
What makes you think that?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:51.480
I haven't really seen you talk to 
each other, outside of missions.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:56.390
Well, we don't have many shared interests,

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.590
so there isn't much point in talking, I guess.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:02.270
But he goes along with how I do 
things without making a fuss,

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.430
so we get along just fine professionally.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:09.090
So you're saying you get by 
with minimal communication?

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.390
Kazari-kun...

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.160
What are you talking about?

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.650
Oh, well, I just never knew that 
kind of teamwork was possible.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.900
<b>Recommended Course Menus 

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:25.820
Mornin'!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.660
Good morning. Thanks for last night.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.610
No way!

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:31.790
You're interested in something 
that isn't a mecha?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.500
I just wondered how accurate 
Kazari-san's cosplay last night was.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.910
The real deal is super cute.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.830
They're going to broadcast her concert 
today, live on satellite TV.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.300
Oh! Then I should schedule it...

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.180
Oh, you're into that sort of thing, too?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:47.930
Huh?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.270
You're pretty versatile!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.310
Um...

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.270
Amu-chan's a guy.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.180
Huh?

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.190
<b>Shinmei Amu</b>

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.580
What?!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.320
<b>Go Go Shinmaruko! 

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.750
Good morning!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.030
I look forward to working with you all today!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.500
Good morning.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.700
"I'll give you a chance for an

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:05.860
Good morning.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.820
exclusive live broadcast of Unit 8's antics.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.570
Good morning.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:13.060
Have your staff standing by at 
Shinmei Amu's concert hall.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.800
The usual news anchor will be fine."

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.530
That means me, doesn't it?

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.790
Why didn't you tell me anything?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.970
It's got to be a prank.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.070
Who sends these things anymore?

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.530
But it's pretty specific!

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.020
"We'll use a Willwear stolen from 
Cycle Tech two days ago,

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:32.140
and infiltrate the concert hall 
using a surprising tactic."

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.980
Word is that Cycle Tech 
doesn't even develop Wears.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.380
Good morning!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.690
Morning. It's unusual for you to be late.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.790
I've just developed a regular schedule.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.160
It's you who's unusually early, Sena-san.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.220
The First Investigation Division 
with the Osaka Police?

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.410
Yeah. It's a sweet deal, isn't it?

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.490
I suppose.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:06.430
You took the long way, coming here 
from the Defense Academy.

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.090
You can go if you want.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.600
We did get a new member, after all.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.390
I won't make another mistake.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.400
From this day forward, I'll be 
my true perfectionist self.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.200
Huh?

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.660
Brother!

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:32.620
I brought lunch.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.080
It's you today?

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.060
Yeah.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:42.200
May I eat with you?

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:42.880
Sure.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.020
Um...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.480
Who told you to act like a slut?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.560
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.430
Get out.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:03.800
Never come here again.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.150
Dog?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:16.040
<b>I'll expose Unit 8 lol 
Shame them on a national broadcast 
Stay tuned       — Dog</b>

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.830
"I'll expose Unit 8.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.040
Shame them on a national broadcast"?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.250
<b>Acting on a whim</b>

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.090
Wait, a concert hall?

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.330
Mythos and Bird are both wimps.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:31.150
This is what you call "keep it simple, stupid."

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.930
<b>Setagaya Ward Medical Incarceration Facility</b>

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.500
Let me ask you one last time.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.210
Did you really do this all alone?

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:39.550
That's right.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.690
Just make a public announcement already.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.940
Say it was to get back at 
the Oonishi Conglomerate.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.160
How did you get the Willwear?

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.280
If you're saying you managed to obtain and 
maneuver the Willwear all on your own,

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.290
you're looking at a long 
sentence for drug use, too.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:57.330
If you had someone's help, 
you should say so now.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.790
Oh, and about the hidden 
folder on your computer...

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:01.710
Who said you could look at that?

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.330
You could say this is damning evidence.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.710
Logos?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.670
Yes, though who knows if it's the 
organization's name or what?

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.360
Logos, huh?

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.140
I wonder what their goal is.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.130
Boss, I have a great follow-up tip.

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:17.970
What's that?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.790
There's a great steak place nearby.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.890
Take the next left.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:29.320
<b>I, Kazari Asami, believe the perpetrator's Willwear was</b>

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.240
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.280
<i>I can't see the perp having that kind of 
knowledge or wherewithal to pull it off.</i>

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.260
<i>First of all, I don't even see the motive.</i>

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.720
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.020
<i>Who created the situation that forced my hand?</i>

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.540
<b>1 New Message Received</b>

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.630
It's a warning from HQ about a sensitive matter.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.360
Huh?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.410
Two days ago, a cutting-edge Willwear 
unit was stolen... From Cycle Tech.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.460
Really?

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.160
But they kept it secret that they 
were even developing one.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.600
What kind of Wear is it?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.330
It provides support for live-stage productions.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:08.100
A single unit can handle lighting, 
sound effects, stage direction,

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:12.320
filming, editing, and even MA. 
It's a real multitasker.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.820
Why would that get labeled "sensitive"?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:20.200
There's a rumor that the Defense Ministry's 
developing a counterintelligence Wear

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.370
with night vision and such.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.540
Maybe it's somehow involved.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.670
The other side's still sneaking 
around like rats, huh?

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.970
I'm sure politics are involved, too.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:33.670
Well, that'd mean the end of 
our involvement right there.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.550
I sure hope nothing happens.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.760
What the...

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.970
Kominato-san, are you sure we should
be acting without permission?

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.640
What if the perp's actually here?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.810
But you even brought equipment.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.560
It's too late to quibble.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.650
So that's the target?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.190
Yes, an idol who's a hot item lately...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.030
I'm aware of that.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.110
Wow! He's cute!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.490
I can't believe he's a guy.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.170
It's here!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.100
Open it, quick!

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.830
They did mention they'd be using a huge mascot.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:16.590
If we're talking infiltration, the wooden 
horse of Troy is a classic, but...

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:24.350
What's that?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.180
Was that the setup?

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.330
No way!

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.750
I win!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.650
This is Kominato. Prepare the live feed!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.040
I'm going there now!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.000
Sing for me, Amu-chan!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.750
I'll take a PV with this Willwear!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.760
But it's not "P" for "promotion," 
but "P" for "private."

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.580
No! Please stay away!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.120
Yes, we have an intruder.

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.290
Please hurry.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.440
I-I'm recording this!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.360
I'm going record this myself,

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:01.260
just for me, Amu-chan's...

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.220
What? Other networks got wind of it, too?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.360
Someone leaked it!

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.680
Other networks are setting up 
an urgent special broadcast.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.300
Just for you?

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.600
How can you say something like that?

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.010
Shinmei Amu belongs to everyone!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:19.030
I don't want to dislike you.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:25.010
I'm... I'm...

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:28.410
Yeah... You're right.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.560
I'm sorry, Amu-chan.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.370
I'll leave now.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:35.340
Hey! We haven't even started the live broadcast!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.680
Jeez, why did you even come here?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.800
You even told us your intentions.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.510
What the hell?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.430
You can't just give up.

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:47.480
That's why you're still a loser at thirty-six.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.460
Guess I have no choice.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.350
<b>This action cannot be performed.
Controls already defined by the administrator.</b>

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:58.780
Damn Mythos.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.490
You think you can get away now?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.630
Turn yourself in!

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.580
Huh? Wh-What is this?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.930
Haruka-kun, Kuroki touched this, didn't he?

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.070
No clue.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.910
He even changed the settings without asking...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.090
Where is he?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:20.140
He had a double hamburger, so he said 
he'd be running it off for a bit.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.360
Want me to call him?

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.530
No, there's no point asking him about this.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.630
He even installed this!

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:28.180
Oh, but this is pretty useful.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.930
It's free, but it can do a lot of stuff.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.640
<i>I finished leveling up in 
the game you requested!</i>

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:39.680
<i>Oh, and I compiled the poker strategy 
guide you requested yesterday!</i>

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.080
Delete.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.070
I'm sure he'll install it again, but still...

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.910
Sena-san, how can you tell what 
Kuroki-san's thinking?

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:46.810
Huh?

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.130
You get along fine professionally, right?

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.870
With a guy who doesn't even try to 
listen to anything I have to say?

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:52.510
Huh?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.890
What's with this app?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:57.300
<i>I do apologize for the inconvenience,</i>

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:57.300
I have to answer a stupid 
survey just to uninstall it!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.570
Oh, that's the setup?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:13:01.300
<i>but please help us to improve our software!</i>

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.840
<i>That's it. I'm going to Osaka.</i>

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.890
This is Unit 8.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.400
I see, at Shimomaruko.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.140
Huh? Shinmaruko?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.480
Oh, the arena?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.560
Kyoukai-kun, which unit could 
deal with that new model?

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.100
If you want to overpower it immediately, 
I'd go with the Alpha unit.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:21.780
Okay, so Sena-kun and Kuroki-kun.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.600
This sucks.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.140
I can get to Noborito the fastest.

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.650
We aren't using that route.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.070
Then I'll find my own way there.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.070
Roger!

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.040
We'll make arrangements.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:37.900
Hurry!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.040
Get Amu-chan outside!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.040
Hurry up!

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:43.510
It seems a female newscaster 
has been left behind.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.410
Confirm how many are in need of rescue.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:45.970
Roger!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.430
A-Are you okay?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.070
Please wake up. Hey!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.660
Crap! Move...

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.940
Move, damn it!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.810
I... I just want to get out of here...

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:07.360
This is the police!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.590
You are under arrest for forcible 
obstruction of business,

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.080
property damage, and damage to the building.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.290
Thank God you're here.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.460
Target ignored the warning and attacked.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.900
Immediate escalation to Level 4.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:23.380
According to Provision 12 of 
the Secret Service Act,

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.380
you're now allowed to use material force.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.380
We can't!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.470
We were caught off-guard, 
and vision and hearing are shot.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.250
Both sensors at maximum threshold.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.800
Protective channels have been activated.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.760
We're still fine. Our channel's still on-line.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.450
Oscar II, follow my instructions.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.020
Haruka-san, please instruct Oscar I.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:38.730
Got it.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.690
Roger.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:40.930
All right!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.430
Hey, you!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:44.990
According to Provision 12—

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.250
Wrong direction!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.370
At your six!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.110
Huh?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:50.320
Oscar I, target is thirteen degrees to 
your right, four meters away!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.780
Oscar II, aim a punch 
three meters straight ahead.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.540
Ninety degrees to the right!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.000
Who said that one?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:58.870
It was me!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:14:59.710
Are you talking to me?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.330
Direct strike with the right arm.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.880
All right!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.720
Oscar II, that instruction was for Oscar I!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.680
That's easy for you to say...

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.480
Oscar I!

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.250
Huh?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.440
Impossible.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:17.950
The perp's tuned his visual and 
audio functions to the limit!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.640
What does that mean?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:25.670
He can instantly calculate direction of attack 
based on the sound caused by displaced air,

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:28.620
as well as adjust his stance to avoid the attack.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.660
Boss, request permission to use 
munitions up to Rank B!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.490
Granted!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.280
That was fast!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.950
Oscar I and II, munitions headed your way!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.270
Confirming permission to launch 
emergency-assault unit.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:39.960
Confirmed.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.190
Launch permission granted.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.170
Permission granted!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.130
Launching!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:53.760
My vision's back.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.340
Why did you hit me?

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.790
Right back at you!

00:15:58.790 --> 00:15:59.710
Um...

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:00.770
Huh?!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.400
Please help me already.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.380
We didn't come here to help you!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.790
We're here to arrest you!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:08.650
Oh, that must be it.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:17.870
Huh?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.090
He's fast.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.490
Speed and directivity differ 
from the first attack.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.930
Could a third party be remotely controlling it?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.230
Is it equipped with a remote control 
system for industrial units?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:38.720
Here!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.220
Got it.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:45.810
Wait! I can't control my movements!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.810
Argument denied!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.600
A weighted sticky shot...

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:55.990
Then their next move will be to incapacitate 
the enemy with an ECM net.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:02.810
Crap!

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:05.580
Has he been drilling with 
this unit or something?

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.180
Incoming! Set noise-canceler mode!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.100
Noise-canceler mode?

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:18.050
I've already analyzed the enemy's audio attack.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.520
By emitting its antiphase, I've neutralized it.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.940
Huh?

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.650
Th-The batteries!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.220
The core batteries of all 
units were forcibly purged!

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.330
They're on backup power now.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.560
That's impossible!

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.230
I'm heading to the site.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.660
Can you distract the perp while I do repairs?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.080
Bastard! What's he thinking?

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.300
I was correct

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:52.800
that they'd leave the battery-vulnerability 
fix for the next scheduled checkup.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.510
They think like model grown-ups, after all.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:58.610
Stop!

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:03.280
I-If you like me, please stop being so violent!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.280
Please!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.640
I-Is that...

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:13.790
Good job!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.570
Act your heart out, Asami-chan!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.780
Amu-chan...

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.990
They infiltrated the system via

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.960
the Wi-Fi system for live broadcasts?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.680
I see.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.670
They intend to reset this system and kick me out.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.740
We've succeeded in deceiving the other Wear.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:35.710
Next line: "I like you, too."

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.410
What?

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.270
Hurry.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.890
I like...

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:41.510
...you, too.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.450
Huh?

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.050
Um, what's next?

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.690
"I'm just so nervous."

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.190
Um... I...

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.650
I'm just so nervous.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.360
"I'm just a girl at heart, you know."

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.110
Th-That's way too embarrassing to say!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.320
Assistant Inspector Kazari!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.540
<i>Ugh... Fine!</i>

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:08.210
I-I'm just a girl at heart, you know.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.090
Amu-chan!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.380
Good grief.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.880
Huh? This is...

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.350
Who's overriding the system?

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.310
He's unbelievably fast!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:32.560
Huh?

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.780
Now that it's come to this, Asami-kun, 
let's have you sing and dance.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:36.940
What?!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.200
I'll send over data for the moves and lyrics.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:40.590
External speakers, on.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.900
One, two...

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.990
One, two, three. Go!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:48.330
Hey, let's keep it a secret.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.430
Don't tell anyone, okay?

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.630
I'm still embarrassed, you know...

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.630
This won't work!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.710
Got it! I'll fix it on my end.

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.550
<b>Auto-tune Off</b>

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:00.180
Auto-tune function activated!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.920
<b>Auto-tune On</b>

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.890
It's... really her?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.610
He took control back again!

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.620
The concert should soon come to a close.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.700
Now let us destroy the idol.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.450
No, don't move

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:34.270
and hit things...

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.840
I-I'm not going to let you

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.800
hurt Amu-chan!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:42.420
Go ahead, if you don't mind 
breaking all your bones.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.250
We might have admin access now.

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.210
Did he just set a password?

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.150
No way...

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:15.920
Who is this guy?

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:20.750
<i>Crap... I need backup.</i>

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.630
Sorry to keep you waiting! 
I'm here to finish him!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.180
Forcing shutdown!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.080
If remote control becomes possible,

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.980
maybe we should rethink network 
connectivity in Wears.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:44.770
<i>Viewers, what do you think happened here?</i>

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.910
<i>Look at the destruction.</i>

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.090
Um...

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.620
Looks like your "concert" was broadcast live.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.250
What?!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:55.200
Guess that'll be another apology letter.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>Well, I guess I can hang around for a while longer.</i>

00:21:58.580 --> 00:21:59.830
That's right!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.880
Consider the numerous irresponsible acts!

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:05.090
<i>Can you, the viewers,
even comprehend their actions?</i>

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:08.300
<b>Unit 8 Performs Live at Shinmaruko Arena?</b>

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>They misused the scene of the 
attack as a karaoke room!</i>

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:11.760
<i>If this isn't misuse of our taxes, what is?</i>

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:13.600
Thanks, Unit 8.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.730
That was fun.

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.950
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.230
Ohakonyapachininko!

00:23:51.950 --> 00:24:04.950
File 4: Holding Airspace

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:54.160
Okay, what's the next ACTIVE episode?

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.410
Hmm, things look more serious than usual.

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:59.840
And wow, Sena-san and 
Kuroki-san are being friendly!

00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:02.070
Are they stepping it up since they 
were goofing off too much before?

00:24:02.070 --> 00:24:04.950
Try and attack in the next episode, 
"Holding Airspace."
